  "definition": "Testimony at an Adjudicative Hearing; Testimony Via Electronic Means",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-28",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
